      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento i mwaka me abirone Yekoyada obedo ki tekcwiny, oketo gicikke ki ludito ma lulo buca mony pa jo miya, Ajaria wod pa Jerokam, Icmael wod pa Yekokanan, Ajaria wod pa Obed, Maceya wod pa Adaya, ki Elicapat wod pa Jikri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci guket i lobo Juda, gubedo ka coko Lulevi ki i gaŋi me Juda woko ducu, ki ludito wi kaka ma i dog odi me Icrael ducu, ci gubino wa i Jerucalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cam 7.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak mucokke ducu guketo gicikke ki kabaka ki i ot pa Lubaŋa, Ci Yekoyada owaco botgi ni, “Nen, wod pa kabaka ene! Wuwek en aye obed laloc, kit ma yam Rwot oloko i kom likwayo pa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye gin ma wubitiyo: ki tuŋ botwu wun ajwagi ki Lulevi ma wua woko ki i dog tic i nino me cabit, dul acel me adek gubed lugwok doggola, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki dul acel me adekke mukene gibikuro ot pa kabaka, ki dul acel me adek gubed i doggola ma gilwoŋo ni Guti ot; ki lwak ducu gubed i dyekalme ot pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wuwek dano mo-odony i ot pa Rwot, kono ajwagi ki Lulevi ma lutic keken aye wuwek gudony, pien gin jo maleŋ; ento lwak ducu gibigwoko cik pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lulevi gibirumo kabaka dyere, kun dano acel acel omako jami lwennye i ciŋe; ento dano mo ma odonyo i ot gibineko woko. Wubibedo ki kabaka ka ma en bicito iye ducu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lulevi ki jo Juda ducu gutiyo gin ducu kit macalo ajwaka Yekoyada ociko botgi. Dano acel acel okelo lwakke, ma onoŋo giweko dog ticgi i nino me cabit, gubino kacel ki jo ma gibino ka tic i nino me cabit; pien ajwaka Yekoyada pe oye ni guwek dog ticgi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajwaka Yekoyada ocako miyo ki ludito me mony lwak toni ki kwodi madito ki matino ma onoŋo yam pa kabaka Daudi, ma onoŋo tye i ot pa Lubaŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En oketo lwak ka gwoko kabaka, kun dano acel acel omako jami lwennye i ciŋe, cakke wa yo tuŋ acuc me ot ki nio kwede wa yo tuŋ acam me ot, kun girumo keno tyer ki ot bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ ocako kelo wod pa kabaka, oketo lalukana i wiye, ka omiye lok me caden pa Lubaŋa i ciŋe, ka gituco atir ni en doŋ kabaka. Yekoyada ki awo bene guwiro en ki moo, ci dano gudaŋŋe ni, “Kabaka obed kwo nakanaka!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Atalia owinyo woo pa lwak ma giriŋo kun gipako kabaka, ci en ocito bot lwak wa i ot pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka oniyo piny, ci oneno kabaka Ocuŋ ka ŋet wir ki i dog ot, kun ludito me mony ki lukut-tum gurumo kabaka, ki lwak jo ducu ma gua ki i kin gaŋ gubedo ka wo ki tum kun cwinygi yom, ki luwer ma gumako jami wergi gutelo wer me kwero eno Atalia ocako yeco boŋone kun kok ni, “Roro yai! Roro!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajwaka Yekoyada okelo ludito mony ma gubedo kacel ki mony, ocikogi ni, “Wukel dako-nu woko ki i kin tyenwu. Ka ŋatti mo o lubo kore, ci wuneke woko ki pala lucwan.” Pien ajwaka onoŋo tamo ni, “Pe myero gineke ki i ot pa Rwot.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gucako keto ciŋgi i kom Atalia, ci guwok kwede ki i doggola ma aguragura donyo kwede, guo wa i ot pa kabaka ci guneke kenyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yekoyada ocako keto gicikke i kin en ki lwak ducu ki kabaka wek gubed lwak pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak ducu gucako mol gucito i ot pa jok Baal, ci gumuko gureto woko piny; guturo keno tyerre ducu, dok guŋido cal jogine woko ducu matitino, ci guneko Matan ajwaka pa Baal ki i nyim kena tyer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen Yekoyada oketo lukurpiny me gwoko ot pa Rwot i te twero pa ajwagi ma Lulevi, ki Lulevi ma yam Daudi opoko tic botgi pi bedo lugwok ot pa Rwot, kun gityero gitum awaŋa bot Rwot, macalo gicoyo i cik pa Moses, ki yomcwiny kacel ki wer, kit ma yam Daudi oyubo-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oketo lugwok doggola i doggola ot pa Rwot, wek dano mo ma ko me ki keni pe odony iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En dok okwanyo ludito mony, ki rwodi, ki lulo wi lwak, kacel ki lwak ducu, ci gucako kela ka baka woko ki i ot pa Rwot kun gidorre giwok ki i doggola ma malo nio kwede wa i ot pa kabaka, Ci guketo kabaka obedo piny i wi komker pa luker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno lwak ma i lobo-nu ducu cwinygi obedo yom; gaŋ ocako kwe mot ki i ŋe to pa Atalia ma gineko ki pala lucwan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
